  "state_rule": "Independent overlapping gates; transition is Itga2-free amendment. Exclusive identity: AT2+AT1=mixed; else transition+AT1=transition_AT1; else transition=transition; else AT1; else AT2; else unresolved. No author six-state equivalence.",
  "normalization": "sum raw counts by library/group, log2(CPM+1), mean over mapped genes; per-cell mean log1p(CP10k). Same denominator full gene total, not selected-gene sum.",
  "shared_contract_amendment": "EN7_library_CPM_v1: frozen A5/A11 membership retained, new descriptive normalization instead of human TMM. Named disjoint derivatives exclude Cd177, Itga2, gates, cycling, hypoxia and p53 genes before analysis. No independent A11 validation.",
  "Cd177_primary": "Within independently transition-supported epithelial-compatible cells, >=1 Cd177 UMI versus zero. Primary cycling-score difference; secondary AT2/AT1 identity, Itga2, response, feedback and shared/lesion programmes. Report >=2 UMI and depth variants.",
  "matching": "Within library transition cells: 4 equal-frequency depth bins x high/low hypoxia relative to its median; strata >=10 each side, >=30 total each side. Weighted standardized mean difference with weights min(n_pos,n_neg); for noncycling endpoints add binary cycling marker support (>=2 of 5 genes). Effect summaries only; cells are not biological replicates.",
  "co_detection_null": "1000UMI seed1; within library transition, hypoxia-half and cycling strata; 200 permutations of AT1 identity gate among cells; compare observed AT2&AT1 with shuffled overlap. Conditional descriptive null, no biological p value or ambient correction.",
