    "Choi": "Reuse tomato_annotated_d2b counts; PBS/d14/d28 separately; source corrected labels for descriptive context only, same independent gates for transfer; pooled library unit",
    "Niethamer": "Reuse alveolar_trajectory counts; author-lineage epithelium, known sacrifice day; 25 animal atlas subset only, no tracing-only samples; within animal state contrasts; day0 vs11 and11 vs25 primary descriptive recovery comparisons; no pooled late trace windows",
